l-2-9781421505985_lg-1-150x150.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:7403;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(77,30,'cover_image','http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/princess-mononoke-film-comic-vol-2-9781421505985_lg-1.jpg'),(78,32,'cover_image','http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/51ubvXmx3qL._SY445_SX342_.jpg'),(88,30,'bookTitle','A Torch Against The Night'),(89,30,'bookPublisher','Razorbill'),(90,30,'bookPublishedDate','1997-01-01'),(91,30,'pageCount','460'),(92,30,'bookPrice','22'),(93,30,'coverImage',''),(94,30,'bookDescription','This time it takes readers into the heart of the Empire as Laia and Elias fight their way north to liberate Laia’s brother from the horrors of Kauf Prison. Hunted by Empire soldiers, manipulated by the Commandant, and haunted by their pasts, Laia and Elias must outfox their enemies and confront the treacherousness of their own hearts.\r\n\r\nIn the city of Serra, Helene Aquilla finds herself bound to the will of the Empire’s twisted new leader, Marcus. When her loyalty is questioned, Helene finds herself taking on a mission to prove herself—a mission that might destroy her, instead.'),(95,30,'_thumbnail_id','66'),(96,32,'_thumbnail_id','68'),(97,32,'bookTitle','a Reaper at the Gates'),(98,32,'bookPublisher','Razorbill'),(99,32,'bookPublishedDate','2018-06-12'),(100,32,'pageCount','480'),(101,32,'bookPrice','23'),(102,32,'bookDescription','Beyond the Empire and within it, the threat of war looms ever larger.\r\n\r\nThe Blood Shrike, Helene Aquilla, is assailed on all sides. Emperor Marcus, haunted by his past, grows increasingly unstable, while the Commandant capitalizes on his madness to bolster her own power. As Helene searches for a way to hold back the approaching darkness, her sister’s life and the lives of all those in the Empire hang in the balance.\r\n\r\nFar to the east, Laia of Serra knows the fate of the world lies not in the machinations of the Martial court, but in stopping the Nightbringer. But while hunting for a way to bring him down, Laia faces unexpected threats from those she hoped would aid her, and is drawn into a battle she never thought she’d have to fight.\r\n\r\nAnd in the land between the living and the dead, Elias Veturius has given up his freedom to serve as Soul Catcher. But in doing so, he has vowed himself to an ancient power that will stop at nothing to ensure Elias’s devotion–even at the cost of his humanity.'),(106,52,'_wp_attached_file','2024/10/206780522.jpg'),(107,52,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:299;s:6:\"height\";i:450;s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"2024/10/206780522.jpg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:80369;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"206780522-199x300.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:199;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:30838;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"206780522-150x150.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:12889;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(108,52,'_wp_attachment_image_alt','Heir book cover with a person standing on a mountain with a lot of blues.'),(109,52,'_wp_attachment_custom_header_last_used_ae_wpdfinal/ae_wpdfinal','1728430594'),(110,52,'_wp_attachment_is_custom_header','ae_wpdfinal/ae_wpdfinal'),(119,64,'_wp_attached_file','2024/10/213075476-scaled.jpg'),(120,64,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:7:{s:5:\"width\";i:1706;s:6:\"height\";i:2560;s:4:\"file\";s:28:\"2024/10/213075476-scaled.jpg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:860631;s:5:\"sizes\";a:6:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"213075476-200x300.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:200;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:32678;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:22:\"213075476-682x1024.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:682;s:6:\"height\";i:1024;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:219107;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"213075476-150x150.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:16696;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:22:\"213075476-768x1153.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:1153;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:262598;}s:9:\"1536x1536\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:23:\"213075476-1023x1536.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:1023;s:6:\"height\";i:1536;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:407528;}s:9:\"2048x2048\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:23:\"213075476-1365x2048.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:1365;s:6:\"height\";i:2048;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:625167;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}s:14:\"original_image\";s:13:\"213075476.jpg\";}'),(121,63,'_edit_last','1'),(122,63,'_thumbnail_id','64'),(123,63,'bookTitle','Ember In The Ashes'),(124,63,'bookPublisher','Razorbill'),(125,63,'bookPublishedDate','2015-04-28'),(126,63,'pageCount','480'),(127,63,'bookPrice','23'),(128,63,'bookDescription','LAIA IS A SLAVE. ELIAS IS A SOLDIER. NEITHER IS FREE.\r\n\r\nUnder the Martial Empire, defiance is met with death. Those who do not vow their blood and bodies to the Emperor risk the execution of their loved ones and the destruction of all they hold dear.\r\n\r\nIt is in this brutal world, inspired by ancient Rome, that Laia lives with her grandparents and older brother. The family ekes out an existence in the Empire’s impoverished backstreets. They do not challenge the Empire. They’ve seen what happens to those who do.\r\n\r\nBut when Laia’s brother is arrested for treason, Laia is forced to make a decision. In exchange for help from rebels who promise to rescue her brother, she will risk her life to spy for them from within the Empire’s greatest military academy.\r\n\r\nThere, Laia meets Elias, the school’s finest soldier—and secretly, its most unwilling. Elias wants only to be free of the tyranny he’s being trained to enforce. He and Laia will soon realize that their destinies are intertwined—and that their choices will change the fate of the Empire itself.'),(129,63,'_edit_lock','1728444535:1'),(133,66,'_wp_attached_file','2024/10/213075405-scaled.jpg'),(134,66,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:7:{s:5:\"width\";i:1707;s:6:\"height\";i:2560;s:4:\"file\";s:28:\"2024/10/213075405-scaled.jpg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:985516;s:5:\"sizes\";a:6:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"213075405-200x300.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:200;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:29872;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:22:\"213075405-683x1024.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:683;s:6:\"height\";i:1024;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:237628;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:21:\"213075405-150x150.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:15714;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:22:\"213075405-768x1152.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:1152;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\"